<view class="page-shell account-data">
  <view wx:if="{{!available}}" class="account-data__empty">当前未登录账号，请返回首页后重新登录。</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="account-data__card">
      <view class="account-data__label">云端学习同步</view>
      <view class="account-data__value">{{syncText}}</view>
      <text wx:if="{{syncNotice}}">{{syncNotice}}</text>
      <text>登录时会自动恢复此前记录，日常学习也会自动保存。</text>
      <button wx:if="{{retryVisible}}" class="account-data__button" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:tap="onRetrySync">立即重试</button>
    </view>
    <view class="account-data__card">
      <view class="account-data__title">清除学习数据</view>
      <text>保留昵称、头像和学习设置，清除云端学习记录。</text>
      <button class="account-data__button account-data__button--danger" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:tap="onClearLearningData">清除学习数据</button>
    </view>
    <view class="account-data__card">
      <view class="account-data__title">退出登录</view>
      <text>退出后本机记录会保留；下次使用同一微信登录会自动恢复。</text>
      <button class="account-data__button" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:tap="onLogout">退出登录</button>
    </view>
    <view class="account-data__card account-data__card--danger">
      <view class="account-data__title">永久注销账号</view>
      <text>云端学习记录将永久删除且无法恢复。</text>
      <button class="account-data__button account-data__button--danger" disabled="{{busy}}" bind:tap="onDeleteAccount">永久注销账号</button>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
